lab-manual/m07-remotes.md.

199
00:14:58,628 --> 00:14:59,820
Predict before you type:

200
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:04,376
After adding upstream and fetching,
which refs exist under refs/remotes/?

201
00:15:04,716 --> 00:15:09,284
For the topic branch you create: what will
@{upstream} and @{push} resolve to, and

202
00:15:09,324 --> 00:15:10,801
which setting decides each?

203
00:15:11,141 --> 00:15:16,435
After the shared repository moves and you
rebase, will a plain push to your fork be

204
00:15:16,475 --> 00:15:17,335
accepted? Why?

205
00:15:17,675 --> 00:15:21,928
The challenge is Incident 8,
incidents/08-branch-disappeared.

206
00:15:21,968 --> 00:15:23,898
